{"2679040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Land of Seidr", "steam_appid": 2679040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/14c4045c6c5912efbd9d89561f8352e6.poster.avif?t=1782043776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/14c4045c6c5912efbd9d89561f8352e6.webm?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/14c4045c6c5912efbd9d89561f8352e6.mp4?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique combat system where every parameter can be the target of normal attacks. Attack &quot;defense&quot; for well-protected enemies or &quot;strength&quot; for those with powerful weapons, adapting your strategy to survive brutal battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combat system where all parameters can be attacked. No matter how strong a warrior is, they will gradually weaken as their parameters take damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact design allowing for completion of each map in about 10-15 minutes. Enjoy deep strategy in a short amount of time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies who fall in battle never revive. Each move by the player determines their fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad Management Under Pressure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/f854bd9f369be79424f1158ed65272aa.poster.avif?t=1782043776\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/f854bd9f369be79424f1158ed65272aa.webm?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/f854bd9f369be79424f1158ed65272aa.mp4?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   As all stats can be targeted, units inevitably weaken through repeated battles. Healing costs resources, but without it, your squad will wear down. Yet spending too much on recovery hinders long-term growth like skill acquisition. As a commander, you must balance risk and investment to ensure survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/b880240a0621caf6e7e4ae00656ed5cc.poster.avif?t=1782043776\" width=1170 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/b880240a0621caf6e7e4ae00656ed5cc.webm?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/b880240a0621caf6e7e4ae00656ed5cc.mp4?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Horn and Lausram people are in conflict, the barrier protecting the Horn people's country, Greusdal, has been broken, and the massive Lausram army is advancing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Horn people, known for their military prowess, were optimistic and each clan eagerly headed to the frontlines, seeing it as an opportunity to demonstrate their strength. This included the chief of the Solskog clan, Freyja. The people are yet unaware of the cruel fate lurking behind the broken barrier. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers no exhilarating comebacks or legendary swords to change the tide of battle. All that remains is the desolate land and the people crushed by despair. Even if the world and pride they believe in are lost, do we still have the strength to move forward?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/14c4045c6c5912efbd9d89561f8352e6.poster.avif?t=1782043776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/14c4045c6c5912efbd9d89561f8352e6.webm?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/extras/14c4045c6c5912efbd9d89561f8352e6.mp4?t=1782043776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique combat system where every parameter can be the target of normal attacks. Attack &quot;defense&quot; for well-protected enemies or &quot;strength&quot; for those with powerful weapons, adapting your strategy to survive brutal battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combat system where all parameters can be attacked. No matter how strong a warrior is, they will gradually weaken as their parameters take damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact design allowing for completion of each map in about 10-15 minutes. Enjoy deep strategy in a short amount of time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies who fall in battle never revive. Each move by the player determines their fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad Management Under Pressure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"