e yet unaware of the cruel fate lurking behind the broken barrier. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers no exhilarating comebacks or legendary swords to change the tide of battle. All that remains is the desolate land and the people crushed by despair. Even if the world and pride they believe in are lost, do we still have the strength to move forward?</p>", "short_description": "Lead the warriors of a doomed kingdom in this dark, tactical SRPG. All stats can be damaged by normal attacks, so even powerful units weaken over time. With scarce supplies and steadily deteriorating allies, you must make tough decisions to keep your squad alive—sometimes at great cost.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/8a4851f1317710911d3b48c38139afceecdcfa26/header.jpg?t=1782043776", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/7572523e8166e27e2bf3a9584abb701686486c32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782043776", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679040/7572523e8166e27e2bf3a9584abb701686486c32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782043776", "website": "https://nanbuworks.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i5 4310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nanbu Works"], "publishers": ["Nanbu Works"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshot